  },
  {
   "day": 90,
   "line": "◈ THE TABLE — the ring of pale light flickers at the edge of the sky... and does not come. Not yet. The table is being set for those whose deeds are done, and yours are not done. The ledger still wants: wave-3 monsters faced. The climb is not over."
  },
  {
   "day": 96,
   "line": "◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Red Table bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands."
  },
  {
   "day": 96,
   "line": "\"WALKOUT! WALKOUT!\" It climbs onto the bullhorn and stops fighting entirely — full-time coordination. (Allies +8 damage. The rep is UNTARGETABLE while coordinating.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 96,
   "line": "You can't get a clean shot — it's behind the picket line, bullhorn up, coordinating. (Untargetable during WALKOUT — break the line first.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 96,
   "line": "\"The line — the LINE is broken!\" The bullhorn wavers. Nobody is chanting anymore. It climbs down, pencil out. (The walkout collapsed — it is TARGETABLE again. End it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 108,
   "line": "◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Red Table bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands."
