   "line": "◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Red Table bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands."
  },
  {
   "day": 136,
   "line": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
